# REQUIRES: python-api, cuda
# The derivative of the energy in the charges with the prolate kernel of
# PME (D231, D266) on the GPU, in double and mixed precision: the
# checks of python-tunable-gradient-pme.test (25 entries tied by a map on
# the dipeptide in water with a net charge, and 11 in a triclinic cell)
# against central differences of the energy.
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_tunable_gradient.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide prolate GPU Double | FileCheck %s -DMODE="GPU Double"
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_tunable_gradient.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide prolate GPU Mixed | FileCheck %s -DMODE="GPU Mixed"
# CHECK: [[MODE]]: the charges with the prolate kernel of PME, 25 entries for 1168 particles, a net charge of 0.5 e, against central differences of the energy
# CHECK: [[MODE]]: in a triclinic cell, 11 entries for 1209 particles, against central differences of the energy
# CHECK: prolate passed
